      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the alphabetic acrostic piyyut “Etén l’Foali Tsedeq” by Shimon bar Yitsḥaq (b. Abun of Mainz, identified via his acrostic signature), as translated into rhymed English verse by Elsie Davis, and published in Herbert Adler and Arthur Davis’s <tei:hi rend="italic">Maḥzor Avodat Ohel Moed: Avodat Yom haZikaron</tei:hi> (1907), p. 104 (also, p. 200). (The piyyut is accidentally attributed to Kalir in the credits located in the backmatter of the maḥzor.)</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
      <j:endConditional target="#osp_66215_notes"/>
